{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.74 — Shopify discount visibility carrier.

  Loads the stylesheet for snippets/besjaar-discount-badge.liquid once per
  page. It lives in the header group for the same reason the other besjaar-*
  carriers do: the badge appears on cards rendered by several different
  sections, so the stylesheet cannot belong to any one of them.

  It loads unconditionally. The stylesheet also colours the cart's savings line,
  which Shopify's own cart drives (cart.total_discount) rather than the mirror,
  so gating it on the mirror being enabled would leave that line unstyled in
  exactly the case where a discount is being applied.
  See snippets/besjaar-discount-badge.liquid for how the badge data gets there.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'besjaar-discount-badge.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Besjaar discount badges",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Loads the styling for the Shopify discount badges shown on product cards and on the product page. The badges read the live discount configuration mirrored into the shop metafield besjaar_discounts.active — they are not driven by compare-at prices. Keep this section in the header group."
    }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
